"┌ Help — all keybindings (any key to close) ───────────────────────────────────┐"
"│  ←/→ h/l    focus column                 e          edit card                │"
"│  ↑/↓ k/j    focus card                   a          archive / restore card   │"
"│  b          switch board                 c          add comment              │"
"│  n          new card                     Tab        focus comments / runs    │"
"│  N          new column                   ↑/↓ k/j    scroll focused section   │"
"│  e          edit card                    f / click  toggle popup / fullscreen│"
"│  E          edit focused column          o          jump to pane             │"
"│  a          archive / restore card       x          cancel run               │"
"│  v          cycle active/all/archived    r          retry run                │"
"│  d          delete card                 forms                                │"
"│  D          delete/move column cards     Tab        next field               │"
"│  m          move card (column picker)    Shift+Tab  previous field           │"
"│  M          move focused column          ←/→ Space  cycle a picker field     │"
"│  H / L      shove card left / right      Ctrl+E     edit textarea in $EDITOR │"
"│  Enter      card detail                  Enter      submit                   │"
"│  T          apply template (empty)       Esc        cancel                   │"
"│  r          refresh board               mouse                                │"
"│  ?          this help                    click      focus card/column        │"
"│  q / Esc    back / quit                  dbl-click  open card detail         │"
"│ card detail                              drag       move card/reorder column │"
"│  Enter      confirm done (awaiting)      wheel      scroll cards             │"
